<BaseLayout title="Accessibility and preview notes"><div class="plain-content"><h1>Accessibility and preview notes</h1><p>This preview retains the three original site designs and refreshes the included public weather reports hourly when the source services are available. The saved time appears on each page; this is not a streaming feed. Climate maps retain their dated October 12, 2026 capture and matching text descriptions.</p><h2>Included</h2><p>The MAWN directory, Benzonia and SWMREC station pages and reports, the Agricultural Weather home, current and forecast indexes, and the Climate Office home and 27 climate maps.</p><p>Other stations, agricultural products and custom reports open their original services. Those services are outside this preview’s accessibility changes.</p><h2>WCAG 2.2 AA target</h2><p>The preview adds semantic headings, keyboard navigation, visible focus, form labels, table headers, text alternatives, and layouts that reflow on small screens. The target follows <a href="https://webaccess.msu.edu/policy/technical-guidelines">MSU’s current technical guidelines</a>. Automated checks are documented in the delivery notes.</p><p>This is not a certification of ADA or WCAG conformance. Screen-reader and assistive-technology review, provider review of the climate-map descriptions and access to the underlying gridded values, and review of the remaining original services are still required.</p><p>MSU uses Silktide and manual review. These demos have not received an MSU Silktide score or institutional sign-off.</p><h2>Accessibility help</h2><p><a href="https://webaccess.msu.edu/">MSU Digital Accessibility</a> provides guidance and a <a href="https://go.msu.edu/digitalaccessibility">reporting service</a>.</p><h2>Source sites</h2><ul><li><a href="https://mawn.geo.msu.edu/" aria-label="Michigan Automated Weather Network — original website">Michigan Automated Weather Network</a></li><li><a href="https://www.agweather.geo.msu.edu/" aria-label="MSU Agricultural Weather Office — original website">MSU Agricultural Weather Office</a></li><li><a href="https://climate.geo.msu.edu/" aria-label="Michigan State Climatologist’s Office — original website">Michigan State Climatologist’s Office</a></li></ul></div></BaseLayout>
